; Run on a clean WB1.3 installation when concurrent DD and HD ADF media is
; required: Execute NIO:Install-FujiNet-WB13-Mixed
;
; Do not run after Install-FujiNet-WB13: both installers append static names
; to the same DEVS:MountList. Rebuild/restore the MountList first to switch
; profiles.

; Always refresh the operational tools, including when upgrading an existing
; installation.  Only MountList installation must remain one-time.
Copy NIO:fujinet-nio.device TO DEVS:
Copy NIO:fujinet-disk.device TO DEVS:
Copy NIO:fujinet-load-resident TO C:
Copy NIO:fujinet-mount TO C:
Copy NIO:fujinet-nio-exchange TO C:
Copy NIO:fapp TO C:
Copy NIO:fboot TO C:
Copy NIO:fdrive TO C:
Copy NIO:fhost TO C:
Copy NIO:fin TO C:
Copy NIO:fls TO C:
Copy NIO:fmount TO C:
Copy NIO:fumount TO C:
Copy NIO:fout TO C:

If EXISTS S:FujiNet-WB13-Installed
  Echo "FujiNet WB1.3 files refreshed; existing MountList profile retained."
Else
  Copy DEVS:MountList TO RAM:MountList-Existing
  Join RAM:MountList-Existing NIO:MountList-FujiNet-WB13-Mixed AS DEVS:MountList
  Delete >NIL: RAM:MountList-Existing

  Echo >S:FujiNet-WB13-Installed "Installed FujiNet WB1.3 mixed DD/HD profile"
  Echo "Installed mixed profile. Add these lines before Break 1 C in S:StartupII:"
  Echo "C:fujinet-load-resident DEVS:fujinet-nio.device fujinet-nio.device"
  Echo "C:fujinet-load-resident DEVS:fujinet-disk.device fujinet-disk.device"
  Echo "C:Mount DN0:"
  Echo "C:Mount DN1:"
  Echo "C:Mount DN2:"
  Echo "C:Mount DN3:"
  Echo "C:Mount HD0:"
  Echo "C:Mount HD1:"
  Echo "C:Mount HD2:"
  Echo "C:Mount HD3:"
  Echo "After reboot: FMOUNT 11 DN0: RO or FMOUNT 21 HD0: RO"
EndIf
